	(text "EXCITATION BUS +/-2.048 V: REF5020; ONE HALF OF AN OPA2189 FOLLOWS IT,\nTHE OTHER INVERTS IT, EACH DRIVING ONE SIDE OF THE BUS DIRECTLY.\n+/-65 mA OUTPUT LIMIT BOUNDS A SHORT ON THE BUS. INVERTER PAIR 0.05%, 5 ppm/C.\nBUS STABILITY WITH THE REFERENCE CAPACITORS TO BE CONFIRMED (OI-8)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 149.86 111.76 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5faab748-89d2-5345-a133-5f02956b30e1")
	)
	(text "SENSOR CURRENT = 10 uA x 30.1k / R(OUT TO EXC+); THE LT3092 HOLDS 0.3 V ACROSS IT.\nS1 AND S2: TLP3475S PHOTORELAYS, FLOATING WITH EXC+ (UP TO 24 V), UP TO 1.5 OHM IN THEIR\nBRANCH. EACH LED RUNS FROM LC_G OR TX_G TO -5 V THROUGH 2 x 787R, ABOUT 5 mA WHEN CLOSED"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 38.1 22.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
